rare ai civili), o sparare a specifici bersagli colorati, e cos\u00ec via\n\nCARATTERISTICHE:\n- 28 stage\n- Modalit\u00e0 Classica e Follia\n- Musica di sottofondo diversa a seconda del livello per tenerti concentrato nel gioco\n- Puoi sparare e distruggere tutti gli oggetti nella stanza (questo allontana lo stress)\n\nSei pronto a raggiungere il punteggio pi\u00f9 alto possibile in questa entusiasmante esperienza di tiro?", "short_description": "Preparati per un'emozionante sfida di tiro al bersaglio!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "portrait_coverart.png", "id": "3374506842766840", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035428_3374506846100173_8011868378582857093_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5Ow2eXVag7YQ7kNvwF8YuoD&_nc_oc=AdrU_dVwTCZrDul6NtZFi1UHLvlpcefh8BOUzLjepTWxAfZhdWqGQkRIUABtgWC3tEU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2gITCJGL14lswT1nZaxEBvOVXUo8M0TTxA9xUEZBeLDg&oe=69F1ED5A"}, {"file_name": "landscape_coverart.png", "id": "1297686567452820", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001732_1297686570786153_6881590418655907071_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UStwZWB4C1wQ7kNvwG8BG2B&_nc_oc=AdpZWAA4GVsJEmKRdhjahKYcfiyNagSHuGScJjfY4B6Ah-pza0QvBgvyGHZdUGgAXvk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2-dRY13dQunHkXQLCoK6BfcY7W2mPwKc2GR1NnmbMPDA&oe=69F2111E"}, {"file_name": "logoTransparent.png", "id": "545978171068232", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982678_545978177734898_5580729734115745410_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iUNWf49vWjEQ7kNvwECckcW&_nc_oc=Adp19JW-xtzJ0FbwWszZ0YuQPZV_kIBhkZwMtSNC_Fl_kGRTByfLW7_67yea9Jre78U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0yyryfiFQEr4i_u3EYsm6O6cwh_tmEpnVQE70XbGinrQ&oe=69F20099"}, {"file_name": "appIcon.png", "id": "53332014234